<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42793" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρυμνῶδις</span></b>  (sic)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">: λύπην
			καὶ φλεγμονὴν παρέχων, ἢ ὑπερήφανον,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i> (cf. Lat. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>aerumnosus</i>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρυμός:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεύς, καὶ ζυγός, καὶ ζεύγλη,</span>
			Id. (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυμός</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρύμυλον:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν μεγάλως μυκώμενον ταῦρον</span>
			(leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρύγμηλον</span>), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρυνόν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοτεινόν, ἠσφαλισμένον,</span> Id.
			(confusion of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρεμνόν</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρυμνόν</span>).</div>
